stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-refresh-cw" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"></path><path d="M21 3v5h-5"></path><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16"></path><path d="M8 16H3v5"></path></svg>Repeats every week, without you</p><figcaption class="text-base-content/70 text-sm">Harbor Plumbing, an example business. It measures no site.</figcaption></figure><div class="rounded-box bg-base-200 flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1 p-4 text-sm"><p>Your part: about 10 minutes, once. Then nothing, unless you want to edit or stop a page.</p><p class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-1"><span>€49 a month, VAT included. One plan. Cancel any time.</span><a class="link link-primary inline-flex items-center gap-1" href="/how-it-works">See how it works<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></p></div></div></section><section id="start" class="card bg-base-100 shadow-(--shadow-card) bg-base-200 scroll-mt-20"><div class="card-body gap-3"><h2>See who gets your buyers today.</h2><p>That’s one page. Your whole site has more, and the bigger question is who Google and AI send your buyers to. The free scan checks up to 100 pages and 12 searches buyers make, in under a minute.</p><form class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2" action="/api/scan" method="post"><label for="_R_eH1_" class="eyebrow">Your website</label><div class="join w-full"><input id="_R_eH1_" type="text" placeholder="yourdomain.com" class="input join-item w-auto min-w-0 flex-1" aria-invalid="false" name="value" value=""><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary join-item">Scan my site for free</button></div></form><p class="text-base-content/70 text-sm flex flex-wrap gap-x-3"><span>free · no account · under a minute</span></p></div></section></div>"`;

